  "details": "I want UPM package manifest to have some ability to add UPM scoped registry.\nCurrently there’s no way to add UPM registry in VPM. There’s UPM registry that have very useful libraries like OpenUPM.com. However, because there’s no way to add registry automatically, the users need to add package registry manually. I think this is troublesome and non-user-friendly. So, I want UPM package manifest to add some attribute to add UPM package registry to project manifest.\nI think it is a good way that adding `scopedRegistries` property into package.json with same format as it of manifest.json and merging them into manifest.json in VPM.",
